Fixed: Make the boundary condition objects of the incompressible Navier-Stokes integrators store the registered physical boundary conditions as soon as they are registered. The objects previously stored homogeneous conditions until the first time step, which made IBAMR::INSCollocatedHierarchyIntegrator remove part of the initial velocity in its initial projection. A run without velocity initial conditions still uses homogeneous conditions until its first time step.
<br>
